      "sourceTextSha256": "97a39fed1af843460a4a981a80cfb147435fbfb6ad0d682368742afd8d2c650a",
      "text": "**Period:** 2027\n\nImmerse yourself in the authentic spirit of Brazil, from the vibrant rhythms of Rio’s samba and the rich Afro-Brazilian traditions of Salvador to the extraordinary wildlife of the Amazon and the breathtaking spectacle of the Iguazu Falls. Experience a Candomblé ceremony, explore the world of Carnival, encounter the unique wildlife of the rainforest and discover the passion of capoeira: a truly immersive journey into the culture, nature and soul of Brazil.\n\n## Prices and hotels, 2027\n\nPrice per person in USD, 4★ hotels. Domestic flights are paid separately.\n\n| Occupancy | USD |\n|---|---:|\n| SGL | 9274 |\n| DBL | 5576 |\n| TRP | 5265 |\n\n**Hotels:** Arena Leme — 4 nights; Evolução Ecolodge — 2 nights; Vila Galé Salvador — 3 nights; Vivaz Cataratas — 3 nights. **Package:** 4★ · BB + services.\n",
